["司法","法院"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":1}}},{"event_id":"speech:8e25e0df33273950","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2023-05-03","date_start":"2023-05-03","date_end":"2023-05-03","meeting_id":null,"meeting":null,"bill_id":null,"title":null,"party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"unresolved","topics":{"unclassified":0.21711079943899017,"law_crime":0.4586255259467041,"cross_strait":0.09509116409537167,"public_lands":0.0485273492286115,"indigenous":0.014586255259467041,"environment":0.06255259467040673,"civil_rights":0.03450210378681627,"social_welfare":0.06900420757363254},"citation_count":49,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/46/LCIDC01_1124602.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1124602_00011/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"319-340","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"fde07e78ba15e67e70b988cb44473ba2452a2a6381a14b7044ff566027f3e13c"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/46/LCIDC01_1124602.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1124602_00011/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"319-340","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"fde07e78ba15e67e70b988cb44473ba2452a2a6381a14b7044ff566027f3e13c"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/46/LCIDC01_1124602.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1124602_00011/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"319-340","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"fde07e78ba15e67e70b988cb44473ba2452a2a6381a14b7044ff566027f3e13c"}],"highlights":{"law_crime":{"excerpt":"立法院的擴建或遷建案，這30年來在立法院或多或少都有討論，我是82年2月2日進來，在我還沒進來時，81年的中央政府總預算就編列了，然後我們在82年5月就審總預算，也就是華山案，那時吵了很久，後來把這個預算砍掉、停建，那時也有各種不同論調，有","terms":["法院"],"cut":[false,true],"hits":3,"citation":0},"cross_strait":{"excerpt":"兩岸的事務並不是立法院能夠完全主導，那牽涉到國安等等，民進黨執政，國民黨當然想在這個題目上發揮，箝制執政黨的兩岸政策，雖然兩岸政策事務小組有成立，但是成立以後運作不了了之。","terms":["兩岸"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":3,"citation":1},"public_lands":{"excerpt":"役政署是因為有人提案，我們並不是一定會按照那個提案，內政部現在還有國家公園管理署、國土規劃署，內政部哪來這麼多署給你！","terms":["國家公園","國土"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":2},"indigenous":{"excerpt":"你們都講很多次了，我們要在一個對話基礎上來談這個事情，你今天是要談原住民文化管理局或原住民土地管理署……","terms":["原住民"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":null},"environment":{"excerpt":"環保署要改制為環境部，本來是要改制為環境資源部，後來改來改去，大概已經走到行政院內部協調整合都處理完畢，包括中央政府組織基準法也訂下來了。","terms":["環保署","環境部"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":null},"civil_rights":{"excerpt":"如果說要消除一切形式的歧視，但兩邊的法益是不一樣的，基本法本來就是規定國家應認同多元文化，但在另一個地方的法益上又是另一個觀念的問題，所以我對於在這裡硬要加入「容貌體態」非常不解，好像我們社會很在意容貌體態的問題，像我們這種老人會受到歧視嗎","terms":["歧視"],"cut":[false,true],"hits":2,"citation":null},"social_welfare":{"excerpt":"在這裡用特種委員會的時候，我看立法院常常有委員提出有關於勞保什麼年金改革特種委員會等等，我們先講清楚。","terms":["年金","年金改革"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":1}}},{"event_id":"speech:198a7db532dc4815","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2023-05-24","date_start":"2023-05-24","date_end":"2023-05-24","meeting_id":"委員會-10-7-36-19","meeting":"第10屆第7會期司法及法制委員會第19次全體委員會議","bill_id":null,"title":"第10屆第7會期司法及法制委員會第19次全體委員會議","party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"single_source","topics":{"unclassified":1.0},"citation_count":1,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/59/LCIDC01_1125901.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1125901_00004/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"133-214","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"de5e66cbf6cdddd3f6affcc724c2581ffb5cd6a4de59ae08bb369a77d334a3b2"}],"highlights":{}},{"event_id":"speech:742de59c1d2b8fe9","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2023-06-12","date_start":"2023-06-12","date_end":"2023-06-12","meeting_id":null,"meeting":null,"bill_id":null,"title":null,"party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"unresolved","topics":{"unclassified":0.27996225228059135,"civil_rights":0.21832075076019714,"education":0.08457848379993708,"government":0.2085692565796372,"law_crime":0.2085692565796372},"citation_count":46,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/60/LCIDC01_1126001.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126001_00010/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"201-214","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"8dca34a1eb472706857d78d849afa752cf809611b870670b2bb3f31485e8ac9f"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/60/LCIDC01_1126001.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126001_00010/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"201-214","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"8dca34a1eb472706857d78d849afa752cf809611b870670b2bb3f31485e8ac9f"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/60/LCIDC01_1126001.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126001_00010/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"201-214","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"8dca34a1eb472706857d78d849afa752cf809611b870670b2bb3f31485e8ac9f"}],"highlights":{"civil_rights":{"excerpt":"我們重新回顧整個性平三法的立法程序，2002年阿扁執政的時候有性別工作平等法，2004年有性別平等教育法，2006年有性騷擾防治法，這是我們的立法沿革。","terms":["性平","性別平等","性騷擾"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":3,"citation":1},"education":{"excerpt":"沒有關係，用這樣的調整方式面對這些問題，我想大家都希望這個東西，包括發生在社會、教育等各領域，持平而論，現在才發現還有很多機制上面，有的他根本不講，有的找加害人來他不來等等，還有外部的機制要怎麼進來，包括法律扶助、包括教育等等要進來，我想這","terms":["教育"],"cut":[true,true],"hits":2,"citation":1},"government":{"excerpt":"現在大法官的案件非常多，以前是大法官審理案件法，現在改為憲法訴訟法；過去表決門檻是要三分之二同意，所以每年大法官審理通過的案子非常少，因此上一屆時憲法訴訟法改為必須二分之一同意，否則要三分之二同意很難。","terms":["大法官","憲法"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":5,"citation":0},"law_crime":{"excerpt":"現在大法官的案件非常多，以前是大法官審理案件法，現在改為憲法訴訟法；過去表決門檻是要三分之二同意，所以每年大法官審理通過的案子非常少，因此上一屆時憲法訴訟法改為必須二分之一同意，否則要三分之二同意很難。","terms":["法官","審理"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":5,"citation":0}}},{"event_id":"speech:bf32f5b7ad81ffca","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2023-07-17","date_start":"2023-07-17","date_end":"2023-07-17","meeting_id":null,"meeting":null,"bill_id":null,"title":null,"party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"unresolved","topics":{"unclassified":0.15117252931323283,"civil_rights":0.1947934115019542,"education":0.1359575656058068,"law_crime":0.04752931323283082,"housing":0.19105946398659968,"macroeconomy":0.19105946398659968,"foreign_trade":0.08842825237297598},"citation_count":41,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/61/LCIDC01_1126104.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126104_00006/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"311-326","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"6238726023ee697da76bd617bde870e7e28c15e4f79ebe414b9340b6c006cd00"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/61/LCIDC01_1126104.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126104_00006/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"311-326","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"6238726023ee697da76bd617bde870e7e28c15e4f79ebe414b9340b6c006cd00"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/61/LCIDC01_1126104.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126104_00006/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"311-326","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"6238726023ee697da76bd617bde870e7e28c15e4f79ebe414b9340b6c006cd00"}],"highlights":{"civil_rights":{"excerpt":"民主進步黨對於臨時會的看法，第一個，性平三法，當然在上次第一次臨時會的時候大家在協商中都有講過了，第一個是性平三法，就是性工、性別平等教育法及性騷擾這三法；第二個就是臺美21世紀貿易倡議；第三個就是外役監條例。","terms":["性平","性別平等","性騷擾"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":4,"citation":0},"education":{"excerpt":"有關於性平教育法，這是在教育委員會，可能是張其祿委員主審，剩下性工及性騷這兩個法是在衛環委員會，由本黨主持。","terms":["教育"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":0},"law_crime":{"excerpt":"在這裡面我還是要特別拜託大家，就是在開委員會的時候，當然臺美21世紀貿易倡議在過去應該是經濟委員會主審，還有外交及國防以及司法、財政這幾個委員會，我看院會是怎麼交下來，我們都尊重，都是開聯席會審查。","terms":["司法"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":1,"citation":0},"housing":{"excerpt":"另外，有關於談到囤房稅，要講清楚，民進黨在整個居住正義上一路走，走到上次的平均地權條例，包括租賃市場條例等等一直走，供給面一直增加，都更也要一直做，這個是一個很長的過程，房價不可能說一天就……，我們是打炒房。","terms":["囤房","居住正義","都更","房價"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":4,"citation":1},"macroeconomy":{"excerpt":"所以談到囤房稅，沒有錯，我們也必須承認過去財政部比較保守，曾銘宗委員有提案，時代力量只提1條，時代力量甚至提空屋稅要10%，那個絕對做不到的。","terms":["財政部"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":1,"citation":1},"foreign_trade":{"excerpt":"民主進步黨對於臨時會的看法，第一個，性平三法，當然在上次第一次臨時會的時候大家在協商中都有講過了，第一個是性平三法，就是性工、性別平等教育法及性騷擾這三法；第二個就是臺美21世紀貿易倡議；第三個就是外役監條例。","terms":["貿易"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":1,"citation":0}}},{"event_id":"speech:1bf591dcb6b13f18","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2023-07-26","date_start":"2023-07-26","date_end":"2023-07-26","meeting_id":null,"meeting":null,"bill_id":null,"title":null,"party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"unresolved","topics":{"unclassified":0.7425635478637101,"civil_rights":0.11222282314764738,"education":0.030827474310438075,"law_crime":0.08139534883720931,"labor":0.03299080584099513},"citation_count":88,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/61/LCIDC01_1126104.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126104_00008/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"345-452","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"7493a6c4f386afaecdad26528a8f1737b493fc2faea8663147ac7041f2644e00"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/61/LCIDC01_1126104.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126104_00008/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"345-452","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"7493a6c4f386afaecdad26528a8f1737b493fc2faea8663147ac7041f2644e00"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/61/LCIDC01_1126104.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126104_00008/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"345-452","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"7493a6c4f386afaecdad26528a8f1737b493fc2faea8663147ac7041f2644e00"}],"highlights":{"civil_rights":{"excerpt":"針對本條文大概有三個地方可能我們要討論一下，第一個是一開始的時候，「本法所稱性騷擾，指性侵害犯罪以外，對其他人實施違反其意願而與性或性別有關……」，范雲委員有做一些文字調整，寫在說明欄裡面，這一點我們等一下再討論一下。","terms":["性騷擾","性侵害"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":0},"education":{"excerpt":"早上有跟曾總召溝通過，今天我們面對的一個問題就是說，性別平等教育法必須協商的原因大家都無異議，至於這些要唸的部分在禮拜五就處理掉，因為明天有颱風大家要動員也……禮拜五就先處理性別平等教育法以及宣讀條文，下禮拜一颱風過了再來表決。","terms":["教育"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":1},"law_crime":{"excerpt":"另外司法院對於最後一項倒數第二行「監督、照護、指導之人」，可能有不同意見而要增加一些文字，等一下請司法院說明一下。","terms":["司法","法院"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":4,"citation":0},"labor":{"excerpt":"勞動部回答一下好不好？","terms":["勞動部","勞動"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":2}}},{"event_id":"speech:695831bd9f280bca","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2023-07-28","date_start":"2023-07-28","date_end":"2023-07-28","meeting_id":null,"meeting":null,"bill_id":null,"title":null,"party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"unresolved","topics":{"unclassified":0.22012489355662804,"law_crime":0.6688191881918818,"transportation":0.07458132273630429,"civil_rights":0.03647459551518592},"citation_count":63,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/61/LCIDC01_1126104.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126104_00009/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"453-478","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"4039368da877577d757f67de9944678e0a6ed7995b0efe92e1c1840cf6a17d46"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/61/LCIDC01_1126104.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126104_00009/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"453-478","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"4039368da877577d757f67de9944678e0a6ed7995b0efe92e1c1840cf6a17d46"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/61/LCIDC01_1126104.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126104_00009/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"453-478","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"4039368da877577d757f67de9944678e0a6ed7995b0efe92e1c1840cf6a17d46"}],"highlights":{"law_crime":{"excerpt":"監條例，我講一句實話，我們坐在這裡，民國100年的時候我們還是在野黨，那時候我在司法及法制委員會，我提一個提案，要把矯正司升格為矯正署，因為我們要瞭解，我們大家都是當立委的，非常接地氣，我們常常碰到很多家庭因為被關，家庭裡面受到很嚴重的衝擊","terms":["司法","矯正"],"cut":[true,true],"hits":8,"citation":0},"transportation":{"excerpt":"你先看一下酒駕、毒駕致死，這個第二款裡面有「故意犯罪因而發生死亡結果」，然後有關於毒品的部分，現在我們有關毒品犯罪的部分，毒品犯罪條例已經修了，製造、運輸、販賣都是十年以上，這些都不可能去外役監，只有這裡有排除條款，是自己食用的或是持有種子","terms":["酒駕","運輸"],"cut":[false,true],"hits":2,"citation":1},"civil_rights":{"excerpt":"我們在臨時會的時候有押日期，就是在月底前要完成修法的有性平三法，很好的是今天性平教育法已經三讀通過，禮拜一要表決剩下兩個法，以及有關於臺美21世紀貿易倡議。","terms":["性平"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":2}}},{"event_id":"speech:d3c015b03b4d3645","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2023-09-13","date_start":"2023-09-13","date_end":"2023-09-13","meeting_id":null,"meeting":null,"bill_id":null,"title":null,"party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"unresolved","topics":{"unclassified":0.7226004084411165,"foreign_trade":0.11538461538461539,"law_crime":0.11538461538461539,"government":0.046630360789652825},"citation_count":64,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/63/LCIDC01_1126302.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126302_00008/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"215-226","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"897acd1ea477ca146228f386e4832919d0d0c519348da9fabfed735f830e5045"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/63/LCIDC01_1126302.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126302_00008/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"215-226","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"897acd1ea477ca146228f386e4832919d0d0c519348da9fabfed735f830e5045"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/112/63/LCIDC01_1126302.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1126302_00008/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"215-226","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"897acd1ea477ca146228f386e4832919d0d0c519348da9fabfed735f830e5045"}],"highlights":{"foreign_trade":{"excerpt":"本來超思是唯一能夠有source去巴西找到雞蛋，它過去也有進口的經驗，也幫日本人在處理這個問題，所以我們把所有可能的38家廠商都找來，後來只剩下9家，唯一有可能從巴西進口的只剩下超思而已，也沒有各位想像的弊案，沒有關係，我們今天在這裡不用爭","terms":["進口"],"cut":[false,true],"hits":2,"citation":0},"law_crime":{"excerpt":"你看，陳椒華那個連司法改革也要專報，我不知道司法院要來這裡專報什麼！","terms":["司法","司法改革","法院"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":4,"citation":0},"government":{"excerpt":"我現在講一下，會期到12月底就是12月底結束，提前歸提前，1月13日才選舉，不然選舉完再回來處理總預算，這沒有這樣的。","terms":["選舉"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":1}}},{"event_id":"bill:212103231370000","kind":"bill_proposal","activity":"bill_primary","role":"proposer","date":"2023-11-10","date_start":"2023-11-10","date_end":"2023-11-10","meeting_id":"院會-10-8-7","meeting":"第10屆第8會期第7次會議","bill_id":"212103231370000","title":"鑑於本院各屆為立法委員選舉或總統選舉，因參加選舉或助選活動，經院會同意停止召開會議一段期間，已為議事成例；第七屆